-- ESO calls SetBagItem with `:` method syntax, so Lua passes `self`
-- (the tooltip control) as the first argument. We declare the replacement
-- with `this: TooltipControl` so TSTL emits `function(self, bagId, slotIndex)`
-- and we forward the call via originalSetBagItem.call(this, ...) which
-- TSTL compiles as `originalSetBagItem(self, bagId, slotIndex)`.
